{"Title":"An Act relative to the retirement classification of a certain employee of the Acton-Boxborough Regional School District","BillNumber":"H4095","DocketNumber":"HD4550","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S_C1","Name":"Simon Cataldo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-28T10:02:22.123"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"S_C1","Name":"Simon Cataldo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-28T10:02:22.1233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4095/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cataldo of Concord, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Simon Cataldo relative to the retirement classification of Kurt Babick, an employee of the Acton-Boxborough Regional School District.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding paragraph (g) of subdivision (2) of section 3 of chapter 32 of the General Laws or section 5 of said chapter 32, or any other general or special law to the contrary, Kurt Babick, a licensed electrician employed as the electrician of the Acton-Boxborough Regional School District, and a member of the Middlesex county retirement system, shall be classified in Group 2 for the purposes of said chapter 32.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}